.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_MIPS_ABIFLAGS 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_mips_abiflags
.Nd decode MIPS ABI flags from a .MIPS.abiflags section
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft int
.Fn elf_mips_abiflags "const elfobj_t *obj" "elf_mips_abiflags_t *out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_mips_abiflags
function decodes MIPS ABI metadata from
.Pa .MIPS.abiflags
in
.Fa obj
into
.Fa out .
.Pp
The output structure includes fields such as ISA level/revision, register
widths, FP ABI, and ASE flags.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 when ABI flags are present and successfully decoded.
Returns 0 if the section is absent, malformed, or
.Fa obj
is NULL.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elfobj 3
